{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30772","headline":"送顾非熊下第归江南 · 马戴","name":"送顾非熊下第归江南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无成西别秦，返驾江南春。\n草际楚田鴈，舟中吴苑人。\n残云挂绝岛，迥树入通津。\n想到长洲日，门前多白苹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30772.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30772","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}